    <briefdescription>
<para>the class for fast approximate computation of winding number for a mesh (using its AABB tree) Note, this used to be <computeroutput>[[nodiscard]]</computeroutput>, but GCC 12 doesn't understand both <computeroutput>[[...]]</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>__attribute__(...)</computeroutput> on the same class. A possible fix is to change <computeroutput>MRMESH_CLASS</computeroutput> globally to <computeroutput>[[__gnu__::__visibility__(&amp;quot;default&amp;quot;)]]</computeroutput>. Generated from class <computeroutput><ref refid="classMR_1_1FastWindingNumber" kindref="compound">MR.FastWindingNumber</ref></computeroutput>. Base classes: Direct: (non-virtual) <computeroutput><ref refid="classMR_1_1IFastWindingNumber" kindref="compound">MR.IFastWindingNumber</ref></computeroutput> This is the non-const half of the class. </para>
